ero 14</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Highest rating</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"muted\">A 14″ OLED display, 18-hour battery life and a 4.6/5 rating.</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Travel and everyday work</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"between row\">\n          <h3 class=\"h3\">Forge 16</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Most CPU cores</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"muted\">The highest-core-count processor, upgradeable memory and a broad port selection.</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Video editing, 3D and gaming</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\" aria-labelledby=\"comparison-title\">\n    <div>\n      <h2 class=\"card-title\" id=\"comparison-title\">Side-by-side comparison</h2>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">Scroll horizontally on smaller screens to see every detail.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"comparison-scroll\">\n      <table class=\"table comparison-table\">\n        <caption class=\"small muted\">Specifications, owner feedback, strengths and trade-offs for all three laptops.</caption>\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Compare</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">\n              <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n                <span class=\"h3\">Aero 14</span>\n                <span class=\"muted\">Light, bright, long-lasting</span>\n                <span class=\"h4\">1,299</span>\n              </div>\n            </th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">\n              <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n                <span class=\"h3\">Forge 16</span>\n                <span class=\"muted\">Desktop power on the go</span>\n                <span class=\"h4\">1,899</span>\n              </div>\n            </th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">\n              <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n                <span class=\"h3\">Nimbus 13</span>\n                <span class=\"muted\">Everything you need, for less</span>\n                <span class=\"h4\">999</span>\n              </div>\n            </th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Weight</th>\n            <td>1.2 kg</td>\n            <td>2.1 kg</td>\n            <td>1 kg</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Battery life</th>\n            <td>18 hours</td>\n            <td>9 hours</td>\n            <td>22 hours</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Screen</th>\n            <td>14″ OLED</td>\n            <td>16″ IPS 165Hz</td>\n            <td>13″ IPS</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">CPU</th>\n            <td>8-core, 15 W</td>\n            <td>16-core, 55 W</td>\n            <td>6-core, 15 W</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">RAM</th>\n            <td>16 GB</td>\n            <td>32 GB</td>\n            <td>16 GB</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Storage</th>\n            <td>512 GB</td>\n            <td>1,024 GB</td>\n            <td>256 GB</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Ports</th>\n            <td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone</td>\n            <td>2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card</td>\n            <td>2x USB-C, headphone</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Rating and reviews</th>\n            <td>4.6 / 5 · 1,840 reviews</td>\n            <td>4.4 / 5 · 960 reviews</td>\n            <td>4.2 / 5 · 2,310 reviews</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Best for</th>\n            <td>Travel and everyday work</td>\n            <td>Video editing, 3D and gaming</td>\n            <td>Students and light office work</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Pros</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li>\n                <li>Great battery</li>\n                <li>Quiet under load</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Fastest of the three</li>\n                <li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li>\n                <li>Full port selection</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Lightest</li>\n                <li>Best battery life</li>\n                <li>Lowest price</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Cons</th>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Soldered RAM</li>\n                <li>Glossy screen</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Heavy</li>\n                <li>Fans are audible</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n              <ul>\n                <li>Dimmer screen</li>\n                <li>Small SSD</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\" aria-labelledby=\"decision-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"card-title\" id=\"decision-title\">A simple way to decide</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">Choose Nimbus 13</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">If you want the lowest price, least weight and longest stated battery life.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">Choose Aero 14</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">If you want an OLED screen, a high customer rating and a travel-friendly size.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <h3 class=\"h4\">Choose Forge 16</h3>\n        <p class=\"muted\">If your priority is the most capable listed CPU, more RAM and upgrade options.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\